{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33752","headline":"七爱诗 白太傅 · 皮日休","name":"七爱诗 白太傅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾爱白乐天，逸才生自然。\n谁谓辞翰器，乃是经纶贤。\n歘从浮艳诗，作得典诰篇。\n立身百行足，爲文六艺全。\n清望逸内署，直声惊谏垣。\n所刺必有思，所临必可传。\n忘形任诗酒，寄傲徧林泉。\n所望标文柄，所希持化权。\n何期遇訾毁，中道多左迁。\n天下皆汲汲，乐天独怡然。\n天下皆闷闷，乐天独舍旃。\n高吟辞两掖，清啸罢三川。\n处世似孤鹤，遗荣同脱蝉。\n仕若不得志，可爲龟镜焉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33752.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33752","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}